             THE CLUSTER OR ALTERNATE INDEX TO BE EXPORTED.             49000003
  'DNAME'  - NAME OF THE DD STATEMENT THAT IDENTIFIES THE OBJECT TO     50000003
             BE EXPORTED.                                               51000002
