             THE OUTPUT DATA SET TO BE CREATED AS A RESULT OF THE       54000002
             EXPORT COMMAND.                                            55000002
  'DNAME'  - NAME OF THE DD STATEMENT THAT IDENTIFIES THE OUTPUT DATA   56000003
             SET.                                                       57000002
))OUTDATASET('ENTRYNAME')                                               58000002
           - SPECIFIES THE NAME OF THE ENTRY THAT IS TO RECEIVE         59000002
             THE DATA BEING EXPORTED.                                   60000002
