))TEMPORARY                                                             64000002
           - THE CLUSTER OR ALTERNATE INDEX IS NOT TO BE DELETED FROM   65000003
             THE ORIGINAL SYSTEM.                                       65050003
))PERMANENT                                                             66000002
           - THE CLUSTER OR ALTERNATE INDEX IS TO BE DELETED            67000003
