))INHIBITSOURCE                                                         68000002
           - THE ORIGINAL CLUSTER OR ALTERNATE INDEX CANNOT BE ACCESSED 69000003
             FOR ANY OPERATION OTHER THAN RETRIEVAL.                    70000003
))NOINHIBITSOURCE                                                       71000002
           - THE ORIGINAL CLUSTER OR ALTERNATE INDEX CAN BE ACCESSED    72000003
