))INHIBITTARGET                                                         74000002
           - THE EXPORTED COPY CANNOT BE ACCESSED FOR ANY OPERATION     75000002
             OTHER THAN RETRIEVAL AFTER IT HAS BEEN IMPORTED TO         76000002
             ANOTHER SYSTEM.                                            77000002
))NOINHIBITTARGET                                                       78000002
